    "short_description": "Talk to Strangers is a game of everyday survival. Survive door to door conversations ranging from bizarre to mundane (in this order) while trying to sell products to strangers. But beware: nothing is what it seems in this neighborhood.",
    "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian",
    "reviews": "\u201cA lot of fun, some jokes made me laugh. As short as the game is, the idea is interesting.\u201d<br>Cellbit, Youtuber<br><br>\u201cIt\u2019s cute and mildly subversive, if ultimately harmless. It evokes that feeling some games do, that there\u2019s some secret hidden away that you just need to try one more playthrough to get at.\u201d<br>Sin Vega, Rock Paper Shotgun<br>",
